- HN Algolia "Ling-3.2": zero relevant hits; OpenRouter full catalog (fetched for routing audit 2026-11-10): zero `ling-3.2` matches.

Net: the slug is a phantom or a pre-announcement tracker entry. No evidence supports a scored report; re-research when inclusionAI publishes (watch the HF inclusionAI org and the ling-cookbook repo).

